sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Browser
    participant P2 as Next.js BFF
    participant P3 as Keycloak
    participant P4 as Session Redis
    participant P5 as Gateway
    P1->>P2: GET /login
    P2->>P3: Create PKCE state
    P3->>P4: Authenticate at Keycloak
    P4->>P5: Exchange code + verifier
    P5-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
